    "learning_outcomes": [
      "Write, compile, run, debug and maintain C programs.",
      "Use types, expressions, control flow, functions, arrays, strings, pointers, dynamic allocation, structures, files and standard libraries.",
      "Build algorithms and reusable data structures with explicit error handling and tests.",
      "Reason about object lifetime, language semantics, memory safety, concurrency and portability.",
      "Use compiler diagnostics, version control, build tools, profilers and secure coding practices.",
      "Complete staged command-line, library, systems-oriented and capstone projects."
